imize, plan, and execute decisions, while improving the efficiency and utilization of their existing resources.\'94}{\b\insrsid8091327  }{\insrsid8091327 In order to accomplish this goal, several fundament
al situations must become pervasive. Below are some of these fundamental objectives that Microsoft and }{\field\flddirty{\*\fldinst {\insrsid8091327  STYLEREF  "Retailer Char"  \\* MERGEFORMAT }}{\fldrslt {\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof\insrsid8091327 
Retailer}}}{\insrsid8091327  can work together to achieve during this proof of concept:
