\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\fs21\insrsid8091327\charrsid1453168 Implement standards that will allow decision support information to freely flow between the participants in the supply chain
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20\insrsid8091327\charrsid1453168 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \s88\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls129\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8091327 {
