\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\insrsid1259789 Future Goal of Localization
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li-360\ri0\sb400\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp120\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin-360\rtlgutter\itap0 \b\f36\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\insrsid1259789 User Scenarios
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\keep\widctlpar\noline\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs21\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning20\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 
The following are some key customer use scenarios. These will be analyzed and described in detail during the design and specifications phase of the project. 
\par Customers are likely to access the site both from home (via a 28.8K or 56K modem) and from work via dedicated high-speed lines.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \s88\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls133\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 
\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 Registration \endash  New users may search and peruse offerings, but must register to become members before buying. Users are directed to the registration page via multiple links.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Login \endash  Members enter their user name and password in order to shop. Provision must be made for the possibility of the users forgetting their password.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Basket \endash  Shoppers select a specific item to purchase by clicking the Shopping Basket icon and entering the quantity desired.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Keyword search \endash  The user must be able to find products via a keyword search from almost any page. E
xceptions to this are supporting pages such as registration, login, etc., where shopping is not intended to be the main user activity. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Browse by category \endash  Users must be able to browse categories and drill down (explore them in greater depth) to find it
ems they want or discover new things. The balance between breadth of categories and items displayed per page vs. number of levels of depth must be validated with web UI research.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Hot deals \endash  Users must be attracted to special promotion items. These must be persistently displayed to the user.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li-360\ri0\sb400\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp120\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin-360\rtlgutter\itap0 \b\f36\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\insrsid1259789  Northwind Traders Staff Usage Scenarios
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \s88\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls133\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 
\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 Site operations staff must be able to import product descriptions, prices, and other data from internal data stores to the site database.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Site Administrators must be able to rapidly update Hot Deals reliably and with little or no knowledge of HTML.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Marketing staff must be able to quickly prepare reports that show the number of page views and give sales breakdowns by category, product (SKU), customer demographics, etc., on 
a daily basis, as well as for aggregated reporting periods (weeks, months, quarters, etc.).
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Site administrators must be able to monitor real-time usage of the site and be able to add server capacity very quickly and reliably as usage trends approach capacity limits.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li-360\ri0\sb400\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp120\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin-360\rtlgutter\itap0 \b\f36\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\insrsid1259789 Project Deliverables
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\keep\widctlpar\noline\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs21\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning20\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 
The project team will deliver a fully functional and tested site built per specifications to the Northwind Traders Online Strategy Group.
\par The Committee will perform acceptance testing on the site based on the acceptance criteria described below. Once the site has passed acceptance testing, the OSG will make a launch recommendation to the Northstar Traders executive management team. 
\par When the site goes live, responsibility for day-to-day administration of the site will be fully assumed by Northwind Traders IT Operations staff.
\par The site must meet the following acceptance criteria:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \s88\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls133\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 
\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 It must achieve performance targets for the number of simultaneous users and transactions during testing.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}All functionality must be implemented per functional specifications and any approved change orders.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The look and feel must comply with the final approved graphic design documents.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}The site must pass a code review and security audit by Ferguson and Bardell,  a well-known consulting firm.
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\keep\widctlpar\noline\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs21\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning20\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 
\par }\pard\plain \s77\qr \li0\ri0\sb160\sl-20\slmult0\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f36\fs17\lang1024\langfe1024\cgrid\noproof\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 
\par }\pard\plain \s3\ql \li-1440\ri0\keep\keepn\pagebb\widctlpar\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin-1440\itap0 \b\f36\fs32\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning20\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc426970133
}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc481590862}Risk Assessment{\*\bkmkend _Toc426970133}{\*\bkmkend _Toc481590862}
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li-360\ri0\sb400\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp120\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin-360\rtlgutter\itap0 \b\f36\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\insrsid1259789 Risks to Overall Site Success
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\keep\widctlpar\noline\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs21\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning20\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 
The risks below have been identified as jeopardizing the success of the site. A comprehensive treatment of risks and mitigation strategies is contained in the project Risk Assessment document. In addition, there are busine
ss risks, such as interruptions in fulfillment, delivery, cash flow, etc., that are analyzed in the Northwind Traders business plan.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \s88\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls133\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 
\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 Usability issues \endash  design and navigation are not effective in introducing users to unfamiliar gourmet brands. This is a special risk for a gourmet product mix.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Usability issues \endash  users cannot find what they want quickly enough and leave the site.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Usability issues \endash  users feel that to much personal information must be divulged in order to register, and go away.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Load capacity is overwhelmed by unanticipated numbers of users.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Major data corruption or loss is experienced.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Security \endash  hacker denial-of-service attacks take place.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Security \endash  unauthorized data access, theft or intentional sabotage takes place.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li-360\ri0\sb400\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp120\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin-360\rtlgutter\itap0 \b\f36\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\insrsid1259789 Risks to Successful Project Completion
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \s88\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls133\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 
\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 Schedule delays \endash  insufficient staff resources to meet schedule.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Quality risk \endash  due to lack of skills in specific technology areas.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Schedule risk \endash  due to scope creep resulting from request for additional features, in particular to match all features of competitors.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Schedule delays \endash  due to unclear or changing acceptance criteria
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Quality risk \endash  visual and navigation design does not optimize fast performance.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s88 \f3\fs20 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Quality risk \endash  visual and navigation design contains features
 that are poorly supported by the technology. Due to poor communication between designer and developers regarding technology constraints during design review cycles.
\par }\pard\plain \s77\qr \li0\ri0\sb160\sl-20\slmult0\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f36\fs17\lang1024\langfe1024\cgrid\noproof\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 
