}{\*\bkmkstart _Toc481590863}Project Structure{\*\bkmkend _Toc426970134}{\*\bkmkend _Toc481590863}
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\keep\widctlpar\noline\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs21\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning20\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid1259789 Project Sponsor: 
\par Northwind Traders Online Strategy Group
\par \tab Beverly Jones, Vice President of Marketing
\par \tab Darlene Mangione, Chief Information Officer
\par \tab Bruce Oberg, Website Administrator
\par OSG is responsible for overall leadership and strategic direction for e-commerce at Northwind Traders. 
\par As project sponsor, OSG provides executive support to ensure that the project retains the budget, staff, and material resources needed to succeed. The group sets the business goals of the project and acts as its champion vis a vis executive management.

\par The group will review and approve this vision/scope document, key planning documents and the site design before development begins. OSG will meet with the team to review progress at each major milestone.
\par OSG will select an outside consultant to participate in the acceptance review. Once acceptance criteria have been met, a recommendation will be made to senior management on whether to go forward with the site launch. 
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li-360\ri0\sb400\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp120\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin-360\rtlgutter\itap0 \b\f36\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
