\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \fi-720\li720\ri0\sa160\keep\widctlpar\noline\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 \fs21\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning20\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1\insrsid1259789 \tab }{\insrsid1259789 
Scott Fallon, Product Manager \endash  Identifies and validates site design, features, and functionality that appeal to and serve the needs of the target market segment. Works with Northwind Traders Marketing Department to refine user pro
files to meet marketing and business requirements.
\par \tab Judy Kaethler, Program Manager \endash  Drives the project to completion, managing the scope, schedule, and budget. Owns and updates the functional specifications and other project documents.
\par \tab Ray Zombroski, Lead Developer \endash  Responsible for software development, with special emphasis on database implementation. Consults the team on technical feasibility issues and prepares time and cost estimates for development tasks.
\par \tab Rober Harui, Web Developer \endash  Responsible fo
r software development, with special emphasis on web technologies, such as Active Server Pages, dHTML, and UI implementation. Consults the team on technical feasibility issues and prepares time and cost estimates for development tasks.
\par  \tab Lane Sacksteder, User Education \endash  Responsible for testing the usability of the site. Makes recommendations for improvement, writes much of the site UI text, and provides technical documentation support.
\par \tab Kathie Flood, Test Lead \endash  Writes the test plan in close collaboration with the Lead Developer. Responsible for testing and reporting site quality.
\par \tab Inspired Technologies, Graphic/Site Designer \endash  Creates a compelling graphic design and intuitive navigation for the site.  Presents alternative design mockups to the rest of the team and provides refinements based on feedback.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \li-360\ri0\sb400\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brsp120\brdrcf15 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin-360\rtlgutter\itap0 \b\f36\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
